@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Trimite primul mesaj (creează conversația automat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/vehicle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello, I'm interested in this vehicle. Is it still available?"
}

###

### 2. Reply într-o conversație existentă
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/1/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Yes, the vehicle is still available! When can you come see it?"
}

###

### 3. Get toate conversațiile mele
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get mesajele dintr-o conversație
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Get mesaje cu paginare
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/1?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============ ERROR CASES ============

### 6. Mesaj gol (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/vehicle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": ""
}

###

### 7. Mesaj pe vehicul inexistent (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/vehicle/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Test message"
}

###

### 8. Fara token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages

###